This project contains code derived from or based on:

- Music Synthesizer for Android (MSFA), Copyright 2012-2014 Google Inc.,
  Apache License 2.0. Envelope generator, LFO, pitch envelope, frequency
  and scaling tables, and the bus-flag algorithm routing in dx7-core.
- Freeverb by Jezar at Dreampoint, public domain. Reverb in dx7-core/effects.
- The log-domain sine/exponential operator technique as documented by the
  OPL3 FPGA project (gtaylormb/opl3_fpga). Implementation is original.

The ROM1A factory voice data embedded in dx7-core (rom1a.rs) and the GM
sound set compiled from community patch banks in dx7-midi (gm_rom.rs) are
parameter sets for the Yamaha DX7, distributed for interoperability. Yamaha
